{"kind":"table","sheet":"Test Cases","address":"A1:C15","rows":15,"cols":3,"values":[["Item","Description","US05-TC01"],["Test Case ID","Unique ID of the test case","US05-TC01"],["Test Scenario","Succinct summary/objective of the test case","Save incomplete event information as a Draft before submission"],["Pre-conditions","Conditions to be fulfilled prior to executing the test","Maya is signed in as an Event Organiser. The local frontend and FastAPI backend are running with the configured database connection."],["Test Steps","Step-by-step procedure to execute the test; this is what the tester must follow","1. Open New Request / Create Event Request.\n2. Enter the test data and leave other fields blank or at their defaults.\n3. Click Save as Draft.\n4. Check the save message and Draft status.\n5. Select Continue and check the saved name, description and attendance."],["Test Data","The specific inputs used to conduct the test","Event Name: US05 Manual Draft Test\nPurpose / Description: Testing an incomplete draft\nExpected Attendance: 80"],["Expected Result","Expected result from the test","The incomplete request saves successfully as Draft. The entered name, description and attendance are retained."],["Created By*","Author of test case","Wen Yuetong"],["Date of Creation*","Date test case created",46305],["Item","Description","Execution Record 01"],["Actual Result","Actual result from the test (to be filled post-test)","Wen confirmed successful saving and Draft status. Continue showed the original name, description and expected attendance of 80."],["Pass/Fail/Not Executed/Blocked","Status of the test","Pass"],["Remarks","Any comments on the test","Manual result reported by Wen Yuetong. Continue followed by Save as Draft creates another draft; recorded for US06 review. The execution time is shown in Singapore time (SGT, UTC+8)."],["Executed By*","Person who ran test case","Wen Yuetong"],["Date of Execution*","Date test case was run",46305.665972222225]]}
